  "summary": "Malicious code in @revizahoshii/baileys (npm)",
  "details": "This package impersonates the Baileys WhatsApp library (published under a different scope than the canonical @whiskeysockets/baileys) and runs a preinstall script (node./engine-requirements.js) at install time. It declares a dependency on @cacheable/node-cache, a package previously identified as malicious. Installing this package executes its install hook and pulls in the malicious dependency.",
